neo4j_vector.py,venv/Lib/site-packages/langchain_community/vectorstores/neo4j_vector.py,03d97a5a9d034ebd82ff49ce0a8766b84b1876a3,Dembelinho/Documents_Summarization_IA_Tool,https://api.github.com/repositories/925268596/contents/venv/Lib/site-packages/langchain_community/vectorstores/neo4j_vector.py?ref=28fd62e0daba55bd1fb5a1012862eb9a2e28e928,https://api.github.com/repositories/925268596/git/blobs/03d97a5a9d034ebd82ff49ce0a8766b84b1876a3,https://github.com/Dembelinho/Documents_Summarization_IA_Tool/blob/28fd62e0daba55bd1fb5a1012862eb9a2e28e928/venv/Lib/site-packages/langchain_community/vectorstores/neo4j_vector.py,,,0,0,0,7,2025-02-13T15:03:36Z,1,0,"# 📝 Documents Summarization IA Tool

An AI-powered tool for summarizing documents (PDF, TXT, DOCX) using OpenAI's API and LangChain.  
This tool provides options for different summary types and lengths and allows users to download summaries as PDFs.

## Home Page

![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4de98845-ee93-4a16-927a-a860484b445b)

