_runner.py,chatbot/Lib/site-packages/langsmith/evaluation/_runner.py,857e0f69e1aee4febcfc593813f66be9c1559597,DILIP-SHEESH/Local-AI-Chatbot,https://api.github.com/repositories/857597489/contents/chatbot/Lib/site-packages/langsmith/evaluation/_runner.py?ref=1f5cb9b9bc82ba34d52291b22e63bf3a36982d60,https://api.github.com/repositories/857597489/git/blobs/857e0f69e1aee4febcfc593813f66be9c1559597,https://github.com/DILIP-SHEESH/Local-AI-Chatbot/blob/1f5cb9b9bc82ba34d52291b22e63bf3a36982d60/chatbot/Lib/site-packages/langsmith/evaluation/_runner.py,,,0,0,0,4,2024-09-15T05:12:06Z,0,0,"# Local LLM Chatbot with Ollama and Langchain

This project implements a simple chatbot using the LLaMA model from the Ollama API and Langchain for prompt handling. The bot can engage in conversations and maintains context throughout the interaction.

## Requirements

Before running this project, make sure you have the following installed:

- [Python 3.10+](https://www.python.org/downloads/)
- [Ollama](https://ollama.com) installed locally
- llama 3.1 is used

## Set Up a Virtual Environment
python -m venv chatbot

## Activate the virtual environment: ( For Windows )
.\chatbot\Scripts\activate

## Installing packages
pip install langchain langchain-ollama ollama

## Lets Chat
![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/cd5a1127-4db5-4614-aefe-edca470f0ae0)

