run_helpers.py,AI_venv/Lib/site-packages/langsmith/run_helpers.py,c01a50538c71aedab6ee6a287cc31b52621af932,KacperM123/Praktyki-IBM,https://api.github.com/repositories/971233097/contents/AI_venv/Lib/site-packages/langsmith/run_helpers.py?ref=0d3650604fc7daab60f2bcc3e887061510dab73f,https://api.github.com/repositories/971233097/git/blobs/c01a50538c71aedab6ee6a287cc31b52621af932,https://github.com/KacperM123/Praktyki-IBM/blob/0d3650604fc7daab60f2bcc3e887061510dab73f/AI_venv/Lib/site-packages/langsmith/run_helpers.py,,,0,3,1,35,2025-05-08T11:29:00Z,0,0,"# 🚀 AI-Reddit Integration Project (Version Alpha)

> **Status:** In development – the final version will combine advanced AI models with Reddit functionality.

---

## 📋 Table of Contents

1. [Introduction](#-introduction)
2. [Features](#%EF%B8%8F-features)
3. [Requirements](#-requirements)
4. [Environment Setup (ENV)](#-environment-setup-env)
5. [Running the Project](#%EF%B8%8F-running-the-project)
6. [Contact](#-contact)

---

## 📝 Introduction

The goal of this project is to build an application that connects artificial intelligence capabilities (any model supported by Langchain) with the Reddit platform.
In this alpha release, these are three main modules:

1. **Fetching Tweets (X/Twitter API)**
2. **AI Chatbot**
3. **Fetching and displaying Reddit posts**
   
---

## ⚙️ Features

### 🔹 Twitter Module  
- Authorization via Bearer Token  
- Fetching and parsing tweet content

### 🔹 AI Chatbot Module  
- Integration with Groq AI (Model + API Key)  
- (Optional) Conversation logging using LangSmith

### 🔹 Reddit Module  
- OAuth2 authorization (Client ID + Secret)  
- Fetching top posts from a selected subreddit

---

## 📦 Requirements

- Python ≥ 3.9  
- `pip install -r requirements.txt`  
- Developer accounts for:  
  - Twitter/X API  
  - Groq AI  
  - LangChain (if using logging)  
  - Reddit (script app)

---

## 🔧 Environment Setup (ENV)

### 1. Twitter Module
```dotenv
TWITTER_BEARER_TOKEN=your_x_api_bearer_token
```
### 2. AI Chatbot Module
```dotenv
# For Groq AI  
GROQ_API_KEY=your_groq_api_key
```
LangSmith (optional)
```dotenv
LANGSMITH_TRACING=true  
LANGSMITH_ENDPOINT=https://api.smith.langchain.com/  
LANGSMITH_API_KEY=your_langsmith_api_key  
LANGSMITH_PROJECT=your_project_name
```
(To change the AI model used in the Langchain module, update the ""model"" variable to your chosen AI chatbot model and set the ""groq_api_key"" to API of your bot)

### 3. Reddit Module
```dotenv
REDDIT_CLIENT_ID=your_reddit_client_id  
REDDIT_CLIENT_SECRET=your_reddit_client_secret  
REDDIT_USERNAME=your_reddit_username  
REDDIT_PASSWORD=your_reddit_password  
REDDIT_USER_AGENT=your_app_user_agent
```
---

## ▶️ Running the Project
1. Clone the repository:
```bash
git clone https://github.com/KacperM123/Praktyki-IBM/main.git  
```
2. Install dependencies:
```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
```
3. Configure the `.env` file (see above).

4. Run the selected module:
```bash
python Twitter_AI/main.py  
python AI_venv/Langchain_Groq.py  
python Reddit_Posts/reddit_posts.py
```
---

