A modern, responsive portfolio website built with React, TypeScript, and Tailwind CSS.

## Features

- 🎨 Modern and clean design
- 📱 Fully responsive
- ⚡ Fast and optimized performance
- 🎭 Smooth animations with Framer Motion
- 🌙 Dark mode by default
- 📝 Contact form
