run_helpers.py,multi_agent_finance_assistant/venv/Lib/site-packages/langsmith/run_helpers.py,c01a50538c71aedab6ee6a287cc31b52621af932,bayojuvikas/AI-Finance-Agent,https://api.github.com/repositories/992561706/contents/multi_agent_finance_assistant/venv/Lib/site-packages/langsmith/run_helpers.py?ref=a409b62e0ede75bea2aa8658294e9a4875161372,https://api.github.com/repositories/992561706/git/blobs/c01a50538c71aedab6ee6a287cc31b52621af932,https://github.com/bayojuvikas/AI-Finance-Agent/blob/a409b62e0ede75bea2aa8658294e9a4875161372/multi_agent_finance_assistant/venv/Lib/site-packages/langsmith/run_helpers.py,,,0,0,0,24,2025-05-29T16:49:51Z,1,0,"# 🧠📈 Multi-Agent Voice Finance Assistant – RagaAI Internship Project - https://ai-finance-agent.streamlit.app/

This project is a modular, voice-enabled finance assistant built for the RagaAI internship assignment. It delivers daily market briefs via real-time data agents, document scrapers, LLM-based summarizers, and voice interfaces.

> Example Query (asked at 8:00 AM daily):
> _""What’s our risk exposure in Asia tech stocks today, and highlight any earnings surprises?""_

---

## ✅ Features

- 🔍 Real-time stock data via Yahoo Finance
- 📰 Earnings parsing via RSS + BeautifulSoup
- 🧠 Portfolio exposure analysis (Asia tech allocation)
- 📚 RAG pipeline using LangChain-compatible structure
- 🗣️ Whisper STT + Pyttsx3 TTS for full voice interaction
- 🌐 Modular FastAPI microservices
- 🖥️ Streamlit frontend with deployment-ready UX

---

## 🧩 Architecture

🎤 (Voice)
↓ Whisper STT
↓
🧠 Orchestrator (FastAPI)
↓
📦 Agents:

-API Agent

-Scraper Agent

-Retriever Agent

-Analysis Agent

-Language Agent (LLM)
↓
🔊 Pyttsx3 TTS
↓
📺 Streamlit UI

---

## 🛠️ Setup Instructions

# Clone repo & activate virtual env
git clone https://github.com/<your-username>/finance-assistant

cd finance-assistant

python -m venv venv

source venv/bin/activate  # Windows: venv\Scripts\activate

# Install dependencies
pip install -r requirements.txt

# Run FastAPI microservices
uvicorn orchestrator.main:app --reload

# In another terminal, run the Streamlit frontend
cd streamlit_app 

streamlit run app.py


# 🧪 Sample Output

Asia Tech Exposure: 27.0% (was 22.0%, up)
